poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/b697a81c9f3cb435f6b5d754725677a6.poster.avif?t=1776421676\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/b697a81c9f3cb435f6b5d754725677a6.webm?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/b697a81c9f3cb435f6b5d754725677a6.mp4?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and master multiple playable characters, each with unique abilities, movesets, and quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARACTER MASTERY</strong> - Unlock permanent upgrades for specific Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIVERSAL MASTERY</strong> - Unlock permanent upgrades to ALL Characters</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>30+ ABSURD WEAPONS AND GOD-ROLLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/6de457df7335431e84ff2527d519c115.poster.avif?t=1776421676\" width=588 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/6de457df7335431e84ff2527d519c115.webm?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/6de457df7335431e84ff2527d519c115.mp4?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoulder-fired Artillery. Minigun Axes. Flamethrower Hammers. Sword-Summoning Relics. Hand-held Airstrikes. Black-Hole Launchers. Gun-Katanas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two weapons are alike. Each drops with up to 7 randomly rolled Mods that enhance or drastically alter its behaviour. Hunt for your own &quot;God-Rolls.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>90+ PERKS &amp; SUIT SELECTION SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/0cbb8ca9422b22cf24aa0b7e1880fa2e.poster.avif?t=1776421676\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/0cbb8ca9422b22cf24aa0b7e1880fa2e.webm?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/0cbb8ca9422b22cf24aa0b7e1880fa2e.mp4?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perks are your primary source of power, infinitely stacking with hidden incremental effects. Begin each run by selecting from curated Perk &quot;Suit&quot; loadouts. Discover synergies, experiment with builds, and break the game wide open.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE TEMPORAL VAULT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send weapons and items back in time to assist your future self. Access your Temporal Vault from base and bring stored gear into future runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DATA DRIVES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secret combinations to unlock hidden boss variants and craft the ultimate Final Boss encounter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAMPAIGN &amp; ENDLESS MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience UNYIELDER's story or dive straight into pure combat. More modes coming in future updates!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composed &amp; Produced by: Kāru, Hazel Ho, and Hohenheim</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPDATES AND ROADMAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Content, QOL improvements and Gameplay refinements to come in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EREBUS, THE CAPITAL CITY OF ANTARCTICA, 1972</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/2e73044bdd543c01b750ea2aa95dd8d7.poster.avif?t=1776421676\" width=600 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/2e73044bdd543c01b750ea2aa95dd8d7.webm?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/2e73044bdd543c01b750ea2aa95dd8d7.mp4?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hotspot for apocalyptic-level events, after decades of torment, EREBUS finally collapsed. Towering derelicts of the once concrete utopia are buried in dunes of rust: “PNEUMA”, a by-product of entropic weapons; Man-made &quot;Heaven&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/2b129312c1e9c5758ee9a6be4dcddb74.poster.avif?t=1776421676\" width=600 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/2b129312c1e9c5758ee9a6be4dcddb74.webm?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/2b129312c1e9c5758ee9a6be4dcddb74.mp4?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a brood of passionate artists, designers, and developers. Come say hi! We don't bite unless you want us to :&gt; <br>Don't be afraid to talk to us, we're busy working on the game but will respond when we're able to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be actively working on updating the game based on your suggestions and feedback. All forms of contribution are appreciated!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHOTOSENSITIVITY/ EPILEPSY WARNING:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A very small percentage of individuals may experience epileptic seizures when exposed to certain light patterns or flashing lights. Exposure to certain patterns or backgrounds on a computer screen, or while playing video games, may induce an epileptic seizure in these individuals. Certain conditions may induce previously undetected epileptic symptoms even in persons who have no history of prior seizures or epilepsy. If you experience any of the following symptoms while playing a video or computer game - dizziness, altered vision, eye or muscle twitches, loss of awareness, disorientation, any involuntary movement, or convulsions - IMMEDIATELY discontinue use and consult your physician before resuming play.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While we work on improvements, if it’s too much to handle, Settings are available to adjust the intensity of Visuals and Camera Shake.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRUEWORLD STUDIOS' DEBUT PROJECT: UNYIELDER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/26602451b39e89ba9780f9d706362137.poster.avif?t=1776421676\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/26602451b39e89ba9780f9d706362137.webm?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/extras/26602451b39e89ba9780f9d706362137.mp4?t=1776421676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1V1 BOSS FIGHTS, BACK TO BACK TO BACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragrap