much to handle, Settings are available to adjust the intensity of Visuals and Camera Shake.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "UNYIELDER is an intense Boss-rush Movement-FPS. Assemble your arsenal of destruction, smash your way through waves of bosses, face your own Final-Boss.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "reviews": "“UNYIELDER is an amazing spectacle, although my skill level might be a little lower than what the game is demanding. If you can keep up, you’ll find a lightning-fast roguelite where every fight might be your last.”<br>75/100 – GameGrin<br><br>“The idea of battling only bosses in a game makes it very scary, but also incredibly challenging. And that’s what UNYIELDER sets out to do. Its focus is to provide a very distinct, beautiful world with a stunning, yet rather old-school visual style, where you will battle all these monsters. We’re all tired of those games where you continually battle tons and tons of smaller enemies as you get to the big guy.”<br>85/100 –  SOFTPEDIA<br><br>“UNYIELDER is brutal. Not everyone will like the high learning curve, but if you can handle its intensity, you'll discover a one-of-a-kind rogue-looter.”<br>71/100 – noobfeed<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/76bc90c5369e3424f5f68b0bfd7e6bdb81a0471c/header.jpg?t=1776421676", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/0be60679b76e40459b656343b6bac7b1127e9f56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776421676", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789940/0be60679b76e40459b656343b6bac7b1127e9f56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776421676", "website": "https://shueisha-games.com/en/games/unyielder/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/ 11 (64b